#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:15
msgid "Discover Revisions features and choices"
msgstr "Opdag revisionsfunktioner og valgmuligheder"

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:15
msgid ""
"Discover separate native revision, archive and duplication post types and "
"fields, revision statuses and active Pro/integration state. Supply post_id "
"for source permissions, available templates and taxonomy assignment "
"choices. Revisions are separate from the published source post. Native "
"capabilities and source read access are enforced."
msgstr ""
"Opdag separate native revisions-, arkiv- og duplikatindlægstyper og felter, "
"revisionsstatusser og aktiv Pro/integrationstilstand. Angiv post_id for "
"kilde tilladelser, tilgængelige skabeloner og taksonomi "
"tildelingsmuligheder. Revisioner er adskilt fra det offentliggjorte "
"kildeindlæg. Native kapabiliteter og kilde læseadgang håndhæves."

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:16
msgid "Find revisions and past revisions"
msgstr "Find revisioner og tidligere revisioner"

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:16
msgid ""
"Browse a bounded native revision queue or WordPress archive. Filter by "
"source post, status, author or title. Every returned revision and source "
"requires native read access. Other users’ restricted revisions are excluded."
msgstr ""
"Gennemse en begrænset native revisionskø eller WordPress-arkiv. Filtrer "
"efter kildeindlæg, status, forfatter eller titel. Hver returneret revision "
"og kilde kræver native læseadgang. Andre brugeres begrænsede revisioner er "
"udelukket."

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:17
msgid "Read a revision source post"
msgstr "Læs en revisionskildeindlæg"

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:17
msgid ""
"Read one supported revision, archive or duplication source and its revision "
"token before creating a new copy. Requires source read access and native "
"copy_post or edit_post. Does not expose passwords, authentication metadata "
"or signed preview links."
msgstr ""
"Læs en understøttet revision, arkiv eller duplikatkilde og dens "
"revisions-token, før du opretter en ny kopi. Kræver kilde læseadgang og "
"native copy_post eller edit_post. Udsætter ikke adgangskoder, "
"autentificeringsmetadata eller signerede forhåndsvisningslinks."

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:18
msgid "Read a revision"
msgstr "Læs en revision"

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:18
msgid ""
"Read revision content, its native scheduling dates and terms, plus "
"revisions for both the copy and source. Authentication metadata, passwords "
"and signed preview links are excluded."
msgstr ""
"Læs revisionsindhold, dets native planlagte datoer og vilkår, samt "
"revisioner for både kopien og kilden. Autentificeringsmetadata, "
"adgangskoder og signerede forhåndsvisningslinks er udelukket."

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:20
msgid "Create a new revision"
msgstr "Opret en ny revision"

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:20
msgid ""
"Create a native unsubmitted revision of one supported readable source using "
"copy_post permission and the source expected_hash. Native metadata/taxonomy "
"cloning, revision limits, builder gates and hooks apply. Omit changes to "
"copy content unchanged. dry_run never creates a copy."
msgstr ""
"Opret en native ikke-indsendt revision af en understøttet læsbar kilde ved "
"hjælp af copy_post tilladelse og den forventede_hash fra kilden. Native "
"metadata/taksonomi kloning, revisionsgrænser, builder gates og hooks "
"gælder. Udelad ændringer til kopieret indhold uændret. dry_run opretter "
"aldrig en kopi."

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:21
msgid "Duplicate a source post"
msgstr "Duplikér en kildeindlæg"

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:21
msgid ""
"Create a native draft duplicate of an enabled readable source post. "
"Requires duplicate_post permission, the source expected_hash and native "
"duplication settings. Copies the native configured fields, taxonomy and "
"metadata through RevisionCreation. dry_run creates nothing."
msgstr ""
"Opret en native kladde duplikat af et aktiveret læsbart kildeindlæg. Kræver "
"duplicate_post tilladelse, den forventede_hash fra kilden og native "
"duplikationsindstillinger. Kopierer de native konfigurerede felter, "
"taksonomi og metadata gennem RevisionCreation. dry_run skaber intet."

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:22
msgid "Update revision content"
msgstr "Opdater revisionsindhold"

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:22
msgid ""
"Patch only supplied editable revision fields using expected_hash. Native "
"allowed fields, locks, term/author permissions and sanitizers apply. The "
"published source is unchanged. Submitted or scheduled copies require their "
"native edit permission; all edits to scheduled revisions require approval "
"permission. dry_run validates without saving."
msgstr ""
"Patch kun de leverede redigerbare revisionsfelter ved hjælp af "
"forventet_hash. Native tilladte felter, låse, term/forfatter tilladelser og "
"sanitizers gælder. Det offentliggjorte kildemateriale er uændret. Indsendte "
"eller planlagte kopier kræver deres native rediger tilladelse; alle "
"redigeringer af planlagte revisioner kræver godkendelsestilladelse. dry_run "
"validerer uden at gemme."

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:24
msgid "Submit, approve or manage revisions"
msgstr "Indsend, godkend eller administrer revisioner"

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:24
msgid ""
"Apply one native action to up to 50 explicit revision IDs: submit, decline, "
"approve, publish a scheduled revision now, unschedule, trash, restore "
"archive or delete an archived revision. Publishing/restoring requires "
"parent_hash and native source edit and approval permissions. All targets "
"are validated before writes; partial failures report confirmed IDs. "
"Approval honors the saved date, scheduling future changes. dry_run never "
"publishes or sends notifications."
msgstr ""
"Anvend én native handling på op til 50 eksplicitte revisions-ID'er: "
"indsend, afvis, godkend, offentliggør en planlagt revision nu, afbestil, "
"smid, gendan arkiv eller slet en arkiveret revision. "
"Offentliggørelse/gendannelse kræver parent_hash og native kilde "
"redigerings- og godkendelsestilladelser. Alle mål valideres før skrivning; "
"delvise fejl rapporterer bekræftede ID'er. Godkendelse respekterer den "
"gemte dato, planlægger fremtidige ændringer. dry_run offentliggør aldrig "
"eller sender meddelelser."

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:25
msgid "Compare revision content"
msgstr "Sammenlign revisionsindhold"

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:25
msgid ""
"Compare standard fields and taxonomy assignments with the readable source, "
"or supply compare_to to compare two authorized revisions of the same "
"source. Missing historical fields are omitted, not treated as cleared. "
"Returns plain source/revision values, not executable previews or signed "
"URLs. Pro metadata providers are discovered separately; credentials are "
"never exported."
msgstr ""
"Sammenlign standardfelter og taksonomitildelinger med den læsbare kilde, "
"eller angiv compare_to for at sammenligne to autoriserede revisioner af den "
"samme kilde. Manglende historiske felter udelades, betragtes ikke som "
"ryddet. Returnerer almindelige kilde/revisionsværdier, ikke eksekverbare "
"forhåndsvisninger eller signerede URL'er. Pro metadata-udbydere opdages "
"separat; legitimationsoplysninger eksporteres aldrig."

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:54
msgid "Default template"
msgstr "Standard skabelon"

#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:132
#: includes/Mcp/Revisions.php:326
msgid "Revision workflows are disabled."
msgstr "Revisionsarbejdsgange er deaktiveret."

